2AZXonCcLOQxnWMCG5ofN20y_afupm5gYl6GSqZw&oe=6B01E815"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 6.png", "id": "2011346012989071", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820980_2011346016322404_297963131427731231_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dq201G7hhuIQ7kNvwEqxLWU&_nc_oc=AdpGmJX9mEEFQfTD00IQHUmbWlEM9upjC1fjrXcVfS7cWq9NIJQ64CZpOIYdbshEqHo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQBF1AlSw7KsRED5uv3wGL0GNF56YRB-U2ncjS-fxhkmA&oe=6B01C187"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 4.png", "id": "1512781303346635", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1512781306679968_8311265691607344888_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ns0reOEV95oQ7kNvwGWi3sT&_nc_oc=AdohL2EJh4W3RkR1Zph9XBeW8i2otubKtMG5IlROK1NqtBtqh_uIkTj7jpqhqumsKO8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS34Yo329DpNPHEqXCrNneJIf50wN7SYCx-wacA8GLx0g&oe=6B01D74D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440 copy.png", "id": "4351475101785831", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828038_4351475105119164_1853464437308931599_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kA8IRhYGY3YQ7kNvwEBiizg&_nc_oc=AdqfCyM0ZXdiGg0qTgQOR7KWoFLSBJLfodJQ8f_1i-jpKpBdCb29NCgj5m8-noNcK0E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQQYeBf1rQZHK0F8Wy3EdRr3YYJePgfguQbGQLu8y663Q&oe=6B01C8B8"}, "display_name": "PutterVR", "keywords": ["golf"], "long_description": "# Lower Your Scores From Your Living Room\n**Free to try for 3 days.** Everything unlocked. Then one in-app purchase to keep playing. No subscription.\n\n**Three ways to play:**\n- **Launch Monitor:** putt a real ball - we read its true speed and line, then roll it out on a replica green with real break. Nothing to attach. Requires a putting mat or similar surface.\n- **Mixed Reality:** putt a virtual ball while still seeing your room and your feet (optional mount).\n- **Virtual Reality:** full immersion (optional mount).\n\nThe optional mount puts your controller on your own putter so the stroke is measured too.\n\n**Drills with a purpose.** Distance control, start line, aim, setup, pressure putting.\n\n**Championship courses.** 72 replica holes on greens from the courses the pros compete on every week.\n\n**Physics you can trust.** Tens of thousands of real ball data points - authentic skid, roll, break, and lip-outs. Dial in stimp to match your course.\n\n**Tour-level analytics.** Ball speed, line and miss patterns. Add the mount for face angle, path, tempo, smash factor and impact heat maps. In-headset, web, or mobile.\n\n**Every training aid built in.** Putting arc, alignment laser, tempo line, metronome, putting mirror, tee gates.\n\n**Play a friend.** 1v1 rounds and mini games over ranked multiplayer.\n\n**One price.** No pass, no season ticket, no renewals.\n\nQuestions? Chat with the dev team: https://discord.gg/2SbUnnpCfx", "short_description": "Real putter, real ball, every stroke measured. Putting practice on Meta Quest 3 with no subscription."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "3543613075811708", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824307_3543613082478374_638908712768740982_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MXEWhDgVVEAQ7kNvwGh-5q1&_nc_oc=AdqwwE3x5fPDzJ5Bd5wuEvc-FuHP0c4snx4_r5-rstbCzw8jeJiOkgBI8Ka24n9k0Jk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQnIE4Qu_Y_oByNV8Xc2o6OWSqmyLpXWK-0thUHwOeD9g&oe=6B01E07A"}, {"file_name": "Korean Quest Store - 2560x1440.png", "id": "2026406291329707", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823837_2026406294663040_7189430179496047163_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MDJRzbIQ